# Newly authored hypothetical positions responding to the cited historical articles.
PAIRS=[
(1,3,"If a lie-detection method succeeds when participants are instructed to invent stories in a laboratory, its accuracy in ordinary high-stakes investigations has already been established.",
["The experiment's controlled, instructed behavior does not by itself establish performance in ordinary investigations.","The use of two scenarios establishes that the method works equally well in every setting.","Paying participants necessarily makes all of their statements true.","The experiment rules out any possibility of studying deception outside a university."],"Участникам назначали правду или ложь в двух контролируемых сценариях; это не равнозначно проверке любого реального расследования."),
(2,4,"Differences in youth athletic performance by birth month show that selecting future adult champions by that month would be a reliably effective strategy.",
["An advantage observed in junior competition need not remain a key determinant among elite adult athletes.","The absence of an adult effect shows that no junior differences were ever observed.","Birth month must be the only factor determining success in junior competition.","Findings about adult athletes establish an identical advantage at every age."],"Второй текст признаёт различия у подростков, но говорит об их исчезновении во взрослых соревнованиях."),
(7,6,"Once an element has been identified and added to the periodic table, practical uses can be inferred directly from the discovery itself.",
["Identification can precede usable knowledge and applications, especially when producing atoms is extremely difficult.","A predicted position in a chemical group establishes immediate commercial usefulness.","Difficulty of synthesis means the reported elements could not have been detected at all.","Uncertainty about applications makes all observations of radioactive decay irrelevant."],"Текст отделяет обнаружение по распадам от практического использования и подчёркивает трудность получения вещества."),
(8,4,"If automated taxis make travel more convenient for passengers, replacing human drivers can be described as a change in which every affected group benefits.",
["A benefit to passengers does not eliminate possible employment costs borne by drivers.","Employment concerns establish that passengers cannot receive any benefit from automation.","The number of licensed cabs proves that every taxi driver would keep the same work.","Any concern about workers shows that automation is technically impossible."],"Второй текст вводит издержки для другой затронутой группы — водителей; удобство клиентов не доказывает выгоду для всех."),
(9,4,"A meteorite appeared less than a day before a predicted close asteroid pass. That temporal proximity is sufficient evidence that the events had the same physical cause.",
["Events close together in time may still be unrelated, so timing alone does not establish the proposed connection.","The predicted asteroid pass establishes that the meteorite was deliberately destroyed.","Expert rejection of a connection proves that the two events occurred years apart.","A shared cause follows whenever observers discuss two events in the same news reports."],"Во втором тексте эксперты прямо называют близость событий совпадением; слухи не заменяют физического доказательства связи."),
(11,2,"Comparing food-production systems requires only their retail prices; other resource demands do not contribute relevant costs.",
["Food-production costs can include pressures on land, water, biodiversity, and emissions as well as money.","Rising monetary prices show that resource use must already be falling.","A resource-based comparison makes all monetary information irrelevant.","Population growth establishes that every food-production method uses identical resources."],"Второй текст расширяет понятие издержек: деньги, земля, вода, леса и выбросы рассматриваются совместно."),
(12,4,"A leader who is not known for taking long vacations cannot also criticize a culture that glorifies excessive working hours.",
["A person's own vacation pattern does not prevent that person from criticizing unreasonable demands on employees.","Criticism of excessive working hours proves that the speaker routinely takes long vacations.","A leader's vacation habits establish the exact medical effects of every employee's schedule.","A criticism of working culture necessarily denies that companies face economic pressures."],"В тексте Абэ, не известный длительными отпусками, тем не менее критикует чрезмерные требования и прославление долгого труда."),
(16,3,"Announcements about transmission lines and international solar-energy ambitions establish that large-scale exports throughout the Middle East are already an accomplished outcome.",
["Proposed expansion and ongoing talks indicate ambitions whose eventual achievement remains uncertain.","Plans to export energy show that every stage of international expansion has already been completed.","Uncertainty about expansion establishes that no part of the solar project exists.","An international goal can be evaluated only after ignoring all domestic infrastructure."],"Во втором тексте экспорт остаётся целью, переговоры продолжаются, а достижение амбиций прямо названо неопределённым."),
(17,4,"A country's pledge to increase its tiger population is sufficient evidence that pressures from the illegal trade in tiger parts have ceased.",
["A conservation target can coexist with continuing commercial incentives that threaten the animals.","Demand for tiger parts establishes that a conservation target cannot be announced.","A planned increase is the same thing as a completed population count.","Publishing survey results necessarily removes the economic incentives for illegal trade."],"Текст одновременно сообщает цель восстановления и сохраняющийся прибыльный спрос на части тигров; одно не доказывает исчезновение другого."),
(22,2,"The age assigned to ancient human remains must depend solely on interpreting the artifacts found nearby; there is no independent chronological evidence to compare with those artifacts.",
["Carbon dating provides a chronological estimate that can be compared with the accompanying artifacts.","Artifacts are the only evidence mentioned for estimating the remains' age.","Agreement between dating and artifacts proves that either method works without any assumptions.","Good physical preservation establishes an exact age without any dating procedure."],"Указаны радиоуглеродная датировка около 7000 лет и согласующиеся с ней артефакты — это сопоставляемые линии свидетельств."),
(27,3,"A rehabilitation policy is committed to the prediction that every prisoner will change permanently after a single prison sentence.",
["Support for rehabilitation is compatible with recognizing that some people may not change and that change can take longer.","Belief in rehabilitation requires denying all differences among prisoners.","Acknowledging limits establishes that treatment and social support can never help anyone.","A volunteer support network guarantees that every participant will have the same outcome."],"Второй текст поддерживает реабилитацию, но прямо оговаривает исключения и недостаточность одного срока в отдельных случаях."),
(28,4,"If a later start suits some workers, the same starting time must be the best arrangement for all age groups.",
["An argument for adapting schedules can depend on age-specific differences rather than one universally optimal time.","Variation among age groups establishes that all workers should begin at the earliest proposed time.","A possible benefit of staggered schedules proves that age has no relevance to scheduling.","A schedule that suits supervisors necessarily suits younger employees equally well."],"Второй текст рассматривает разные часы начала для разных возрастов, а не одно одинаковое время для всех."),
(29,3,"Showing that a drone can carry a lightweight package across a neighborhood is enough to establish that it meets commercial aviation's reliability expectations.",
["Payload and range capability do not by themselves demonstrate the required failure rate.","Meeting a distance requirement establishes the same reliability as a certified commercial aircraft.","A lower failure rate can be inferred solely from the weight of a package.","A concern about failure rates establishes that no drone can carry any package at all."],"Второй текст разделяет грузоподъёмность и дальность с одной стороны и значительно более строгую надёжность полётов с другой."),
]
